OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1786650499
OL,3,CUefa confirms alleged lover of Gianni
OL,4,CInfantino received 'departure payment'
OL,6,FUefa has confirmed a "departure
OL,7,Fpayment" was made to a female employee
OL,8,Falleged to have been in a relationship
OL,9,Fwith Gianni Infantino while he was the
OL,10,Forganisation's general secretary.
OL,12,FIt was reported in the Telegraph that
OL,13,Fthe woman had recevied a six-figure
OL,14,Fsum following the alleged relationship
OL,15,Fwith Infantino, who has been married
OL,16,Fsince 2001.
OL,18,FInfantino worked at Uefa for 16 years,
OL,19,Fand was its general secretary from
OL,20,F2009 to 2016 before he was elected
OL,21,Fpresident of Fifa.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/6
