OL,3,CUefa confirms alleged lover of Gianni
OL,4,CInfantino received 'departure payment'
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FThe report comes as pressure mounts on
OL,12,Fthe president following his plan to
OL,13,Fseek private investment in a company
OL,14,Fwhich would run Fifa's competitions,
OL,15,Fincluding the men's and women's World
OL,16,FCups.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
