OL,3,CUefa confirms alleged lover of Gianni
OL,4,CInfantino received 'departure payment'
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Uefa told ITV News:
OL,7,F"We are aware of the allegations and
OL,8,Fcan confirm a departure payment was
OL,9,Fmade to the individual in question,
OL,10,Fcoupled with the payment of fees for
OL,11,Fan MBA course at a local business
OL,12,Fschool.
OL,14,F"The payment was in line with the
OL,15,Fregulations that existed for departing
OL,16,Fstaff at the time.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
