OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1786650499
OL,3,CUefa confirms alleged lover of Gianni
OL,4,CInfantino received 'departure payment'
OL,6,F"Such regulations have been tightened
OL,7,Fsince 2016 and the current staff
OL,8,Fregulations ` which apply to all Uefa
OL,9,Femployees at whatever level ` reflect
OL,10,Fthose found in a modern, high-profile
OL,11,Forganisation."
OL,13,FInfantino has faced heavy backlash
OL,14,Ffollowing the announcement of his plan
OL,15,Fto sell stakes to private investors in
OL,16,Fa company to run the World Cup.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
