OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1786650499
OL,3,CUefa confirms alleged lover of Gianni
OL,4,CInfantino received 'departure payment'
OL,6,FThe Fifa president held crisis talks
OL,7,Fwith the executives from the sporting
OL,8,Fbody this week in Rabat, Morocco, and
OL,9,Femerged with support from the
OL,10,Fmanagement board.
OL,12,FHowever, the criticism has not gone
OL,13,Faway, and Uefa said its threat for its
OL,14,F55 member countries to boycott Fifa
OL,15,Fcompetitions remains, even after
OL,16,FInfantino apologised.
OL,18,FInfantino is due to stand for re-
OL,19,Felection as Fifa's president next
OL,20,Fyear, and no one has yet come forward
OL,21,Fto publicly challenge him in the vote.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1786650499
OL,3,CUefa confirms alleged lover of Gianni
OL,4,CInfantino received 'departure payment'
OL,6,FHowever, multiple nations including
OL,7,FFinland, England, Wales, Serbia,
OL,8,FGermany and Sweden, have all withdrawn
OL,9,Ftheir support for the president.
OL,11,FThe Romanian and Czech associations
OL,12,Falso hinted that they will not back
OL,13,FInfantino but have not formally
OL,14,Fdeclared so.
OL,16,FOther nations, such as Qatar, Sri
OL,17,FLanka, Kuwait, Lebanon and Morocco,
OL,18,Fhave all publicly backed him after the
OL,19,FFFE was withdrawn.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
